 "content_html": "\n<p class=\"has-text-align-justify wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>בעקבות עתירה של גיא זומר, מייסד עמותת התמנון, בדרישה להורות למשרד המשפטים לפרסם את הנחיות מחלקת ייעוץ וחקיקה (זרועו הארוכה של היועץ המשפטי לממשלה) קבע בית המשפט המחוזי כי הנחיות אלה אינן אלא המלצות בלבד, שכל עובד מדינה יכול לקבל או שלא לקבל, ולפיכך אין כל חובה בפרסומם. </strong></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><a href=\"https://www.haaretz.co.il/news/law/.premium-1.8929308\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-216\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"506\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/d791d799d7aa-d794d79ed7a9d7a4d798-d794d79ed797d795d796d799-d794d7a0d797d799d795d7aa-d799d799d7a2d795d7a5-d795d797d7a7d799d7a7d794-3.png?w=858\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/d791d799d7aa-d794d79ed7a9d7a4d798-d794d79ed797d795d796d799-d794d7a0d797d799d795d7aa-d799d799d7a2d795d7a5-d795d797d7a7d799d7a7d794-3.png?w=858&amp;ssl=1 858w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/d791d799d7aa-d794d79ed7a9d7a4d798-d794d79ed797d795d796d799-d794d7a0d797d799d795d7aa-d799d799d7a2d795d7a5-d795d797d7a7d799d7a7d794-3.png?resize=300%2C177&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/d791d799d7aa-d794d79ed7a9d7a4d798-d794d79ed797d795d796d799-d794d7a0d797d799d795d7aa-d799d799d7a2d795d7a5-d795d797d7a7d799d7a7d794-3.png?resize=768%2C453&amp;ssl=1 768w\" width=\"858\"/></a></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">לכתבה באתר <a href=\"https://www.haaretz.co.il/news/law/.premium-1.8929308\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">הארץ</a></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">הפסיקה החריגה תוארה בשורה של אייטמים עוקבים ובינהם <a href=\"https://www.israelhayom.co.il/article/772307\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">ישראל היום</a></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-7.png?ssl=1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3598\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"279\" sizes=\"(max-width: 604px) 100vw, 604px\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-7.png?resize=604%2C279&amp;ssl=1\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-7.png?w=604&amp;ssl=1 604w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-7.png?resize=300%2C139&amp;ssl=1 300w\" width=\"604\"/></a></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.zman.co.il/121849/print/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">בזמן ישראל</a></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-8.png?ssl=1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3600\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"304\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-8.png?resize=640%2C304&amp;ssl=1\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-8.png?w=683&amp;ssl=1 683w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-8.png?resize=300%2C142&amp;ssl=1 300w\" width=\"640\"/></a></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://mida.org.il/2020/06/28/%D7%94%D7%90%D7%9E%D7%AA-%D7%9E%D7%90%D7%97%D7%95%D7%A8%D7%99-%D7%94%D7%95%D7%A0%D7%90%D7%AA-%D7%94%D7%99%D7%95%D7%A2%D7%9E%D7%A9%D7%99%D7%9D-%D7%94%D7%92%D7%93%D7%95%D7%9C%D7%94/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">במידה</a></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-9.png?ssl=1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3601\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-9.png?resize=640%2C180&amp;ssl=1\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-9.png?w=877&amp;ssl=1 877w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-9.png?resize=300%2C84&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-9.png?resize=768%2C216&amp;ssl=1 768w\" width=\"640\"/></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-10.png?ssl=1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3602\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"198\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-10.png?resize=640%2C198&amp;ssl=1\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-10.png?w=660&amp;ssl=1 660w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-10.png?resize=300%2C93&amp;ssl=1 300w\" width=\"640\"/></a></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">באתר <a href=\"https://www.kikar.co.il/364404.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">כיכר השבת</a></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-style-default\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-11.png?ssl=1\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3603\" data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"319\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-11.png?resize=640%2C319&amp;ssl=1\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-11.png?w=686&amp;ssl=1 686w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/image-11.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w\" width=\"640\"/></a></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">ובהמשך אף זכה לטור דעה באתר <a href=\"https://www.haaretz.co.il/opinions/.premium-1.8965495\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">הארץ</a></p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-style-default\"><a href=\"https://www.haaretz.co.il/opinions/.premium-1.8965495\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-221\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"336\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/image-4-3.png?w=853\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/image-4-3.png?w=853&amp;ssl=1 853w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/image-4-3.png?resize=300%2C118&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/octopus.org.il/wp-content/uploads/2020/07/image-4-3.png?resize=768%2C303&amp;ssl=1 768w\" width=\"853\"/></a></figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
